{"id": "EUVD-2026-97443", "enisaUuid": "6099167a-18e4-3e44-872c-a97b04092e7c", "description": "LogicalDOC Community Edition through 9.3 contains a missing authorization vulnerability in the zip-export servlet that allows authenticated users to export restricted folders by supplying a folderId parameter. Attackers can request /zip-export with a restricted folder ID, since ZipExport.addFolderDocuments() skips READ and DOWNLOAD permission checks, to download all of its documents in a ZIP archive.", "datePublished": "2026-10-12T13:39:44", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-13T16:57:39", "baseScore": 7.1, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:L/UI:N/VC:H/VI:N/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/logicaldoc/community/discussions/119", "https://github.com/logicaldoc/community/commit/648047ee0ec95c294bb983e511fed60dbc67977f", "https://github.com/logicaldoc/community/blob/9.3/logicaldoc-webapp/src/main/java/com/logicaldoc/web/ExportZip.java#L57", "https://github.com/logicaldoc/community/blob/9.3/logicaldoc-core/src/main/java/com/logicaldoc/core/transfer/ZipExport.java#L233", "https://github.com/logicaldoc/community", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/logicaldoc-community-edition-through-9.3-missing-authorization-via-zip-export-servlet"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-109202", "GHSA-q2v3-rpjf-5cc3"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.26, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "c84c7820-61e6-3a07-ac9c-4c24bb4cf114", "product": {"name": "LogicalDOC Community Edition", "vendor": {"name": "LogicalDOC"}}, "product_version": "0 \u22649.3"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "da06f09f-de8f-35be-97fa-9261bbf31bbd", "vendor": {"name": "LogicalDOC"}}], "isExploited": false}